ally, we use professional hardware in our lab to talk directly to the phone&#8217;s memory at a very deep level.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Crypt14/Crypt15 Database Decryption and Reconstruction</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">New phones use very strong security to keep your data safe. However, this often makes normal recovery attempts fail. For that reason, our engineers utilize their own special methods to unlock these raw database files. They put your message history back together by hand. This advanced approach lets us get past failed security layers and fix the whole chat database for you.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Deleted Media and Attachment Retrieval (Photos, Voice Notes, PDFs)</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Running a business means you need more than just text. You likely need shared PDFs, voice notes, and photos, too. Thus, we use forensic tools that scan a device&#8217;s memory for pieces of deleted media. Our team excels at finding those important attachments. For instance, we recover files lost when someone accidentally deleted an app or a system update went wrong.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Our Forensic Windows Recovery Process for Guaranteed Privacy</b></h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">We follow a very clear and honest process for every single case to get the best result. Initially, a professional <b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"114\">Windows Recovery</b> starts with a safe check-up. We find out why the data is gone. For example, it could be a software glitch, a hardware break, or an encryption issue. This first audit helps us give you a fair price and a real timeline for getting your business files back.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Stabilization and Cloning</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-n