st hides the files; it doesn&#8217;t always wipe them. If you haven&#8217;t used the drive much after formatting, we can scan it and find the video. Just make sure to stop recording right away so you don&#8217;t overwrite the data.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"43\">How long does a typical CCTV data recovery service take?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"44\">Normally, it takes about 3 to 5 working days. If it is a very urgent emergency, such as a court case or a major security breach, we offer a fast service that takes only 24 to 48 hours. The first check usually takes less than a day.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"45\">Can you perform a CCTV footage recovery service if the drive is clicking?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\">If you hear a clicking sound, that is a bad sign! It means the mechanical parts are failing. You must stop using it immediately, or you might scratch the inside of the disk. Our guys will open it in a cleanroom to repair the parts and safely recover your data.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"47\">What is the cost of a DVR data recovery service in Dubai?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"48\">It really depends on the problem. If it is just a software error, it is cheaper. If the hardware is broken and we need spare parts, it costs a bit more. We always give you a free check and a quote first so you can decide.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"49\">Do you offer emergency CCTV hard drive recovery for legal cases?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"50\">Yes, we work quite often with police, lawyers, and security teams who need evidence fast. We make these cases a priority and give you the right paperwork so the video can be used in legal matters.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"51\">Can I recover deleted CCTV footage myself?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"52\">We don&#8217;t recommend it. Using free software from the internet is risky because CCTV uses special file types. You might accidentally erase the video forever. It is much better to let a professional lab handle it so you don&#8217;t lose everything.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"53\">Start Your CCTV Recovery Today</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54\">If you have lost your security video, please don&#8217;t wait. The longer the machine stays on, the higher the chance you will lose the files forever. Our team is ready to help with the best tools, and we promise to keep your data 100% private. Trust the local experts at <a href=\"https://Recoverydata.ae\">Recovery Data</a> to get your footage back and give you peace of mind.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"55\">Get in touch with our Dubai lab now for your free check-up. We help businesses in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, and the Northern Emirates with fast and professional support.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"56\">Call +971 56 410 1040</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"56\">Email info@recoverydata.ae</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/8-9.jpg','default','published','CCTV Recovery - Recovery Data','Recover lost CCTV footage fast with Lifeguard Data Recovery. Expert DVR, NVR & hard drive recovery. Safe, secure & reliable service.',NULL,'https://recoverydata.ae/cctv-footage-recovery-dubai/','CCTV Recovery - Recovery Data','Recover lost CCTV footage fast with Lifeguard Data Recovery. Expert DVR, NVR & hard drive recovery. Safe, secure & reliable service.','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/8-9.jpg',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-10-12 04:18:55','2026-10-12 04:18:55'),(15,1,'Server Recovery','server-recovery-dubai','<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_7c207299d9fcd3d3\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel enable-updated-hr-color\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-busy=\"false\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">When your office systems go down, it can really mess up your whole business. <b data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">Recovery Data</b> offers the best <a href=\"https://Recoverydata.ae\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"107\">Server Recovery</b></a> in the UAE so your company ca