abase was back, and they finished their reports on time.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"53\">Common Questions About Server Recovery</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54\"><b data-path-to-node=\"54\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How long does an enterprise server recovery take?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54\">It depends on how many drives you have and how broken they are. Usually, it takes 48 to 72 hours, but we have an extra-fast service if you&#8217;re in a big rush. Our <b data-path-to-node=\"54\" data-index-in-node=\"211\">enterprise server recovery</b> team works shifts to make sure your job never stops until it&#8217;s done.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"55\"><b data-path-to-node=\"55\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can you get data from servers that are encrypted?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"55\">Yes, we have tools for that. As long as your IT team has the passwords or keys, we can do a full <b data-path-to-node=\"55\" data-index-in-node=\"147\">data recovery from server</b> even if it&#8217;s locked. We keep everything very secure while we work.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"56\"><b data-path-to-node=\"56\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Do you come to Abu Dhabi for server data recovery?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"56\">Yes, we can come to your office or pick up the drives anywhere in the UAE. While big repairs usually happen in our lab, we can do the first checks at your place. This is great for banks or government offices that have strict rules.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"57\"><b data-path-to-node=\"57\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">What happens during a professional server recovery service?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"57\">First we check the hardware and software to see what&#8217;s wrong. Then our <b data-path-to-node=\"57\" data-index-in-node=\"131\">server recovery service</b> fixes the broken parts and uses smart code to put the data back together. We check the files to make sure they work before giving them back to you.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"58\"><b data-pa