de=\"54,0,0\">It is possible if it was only partially overwritten or if we catch it fast enough. The sooner you turn the machine off, the better the chance!</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"54,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How long does it take to get data back from a DVR?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54,1,0\">Usually, it takes 3 to 5 days. For emergencies, we can often do it in 1 or 2 days, depending on how broken the drive is.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"54,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Is it possible to retrieve deleted security camera clips?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54,2,0\">Yes! When you delete a clip, it stays on the drive for a while until a new video takes its place. We use forensic tools to find them.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"54,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">What is the success rate for water-damaged drives?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54,3,0\">As long as the inside of the drive isn&#8217;t scratched or dirty, we have a very high success rate in our cleanroom.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"54,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Do you keep my video private?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54,4,0\">Yes, always. We can sign a privacy paper (NDA) for you. Your videos are treated with total secrecy.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"54,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can I get the video back if the camera was stolen?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"54,5,0\">If the recorder box (DVR) is still there, yes. If the thief took the box and there&#8217;s no cloud backup, then unfortunately, it&#8217;s gone.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"55\">Contact Recovery Data Dubai Today</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"56\">Your security video is often the only real witness to what happened. If that witness has gone quiet, let us help you find its voice again. We are right here in Dubai, and we can even help with your device fo