s, nobody could move.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28\">The client called us. We did an <b data-path-to-node=\"28\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">on-site data recovery assessment in Sharjah</b> and took the disks to our lab. By midnight, we had fixed the drives in our cleanroom. The next morning, the server was rebuilt virtually. Only 18 hours after the call, they had their data back, and the trucks were finally moving again.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"29\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How fast is same-day data retrieval in the Sharjah Industrial Area?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\">If it&#8217;s a simple software problem, we can usually get your files back in 8 to 12 hours. If we have to fix the drive&#8217;s internal parts, it might take a full day.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Is the 24/7 data recovery service in Sharjah more expensive?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\">Yes, because we have engineers working through the night just for you. But usually, the cost is much less than the money your company loses every hour the factory is closed!</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32\"><b data-path-to-node=\"32\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">My server is clicking. What do I do?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32\">Turn it off immediately! A clicking sound means the internal parts are touching the data platters. If you keep it running, you could &#8220;grind&#8221; away your data forever.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"33\"><b data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can you recover data from industrial-grade SSDs in Sharjah?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"33\">Yes. We have special tools to talk to failed SSDs and read the chips directly. It’s hard work, but we are very good at it.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34\"><b data-path-to-node=\"34\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why is Recovery Data the fastest lab in Sharjah?</b></p>