ing from Ubuntu to old-school UNIX systems. Our lab is a very secure place, so you don&#8217;t have to worry about your private records ever being seen by the wrong people.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">Safe Data Handling and Privacy</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Nowadays, keeping data private is a legal requirement in the UAE. Our rules follow the law perfectly. From the moment your server arrives at our spot near <b data-path-to-node=\"12\" data-index-in-node=\"155\">Industrial Area 10</b>, we track it every step of the way. We also sign &#8220;Non-Disclosure Agreements&#8221; (NDAs) for our business clients.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">This means your money records, staff info, and trade secrets stay 100% confidential while we work.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\">Cleanroom for Fixing Enterprise Drives</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">Server drives are built to run 24/7, but they still break. If you open a high-speed SAS drive in a normal office, the dust in the air will kill the data instantly. Our lab has a &#8220;Class 100 Cleanroom&#8221; which is basically a super clean, dust-free room. Our techs go in there to swap out broken parts or fix the platters.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">This is a must-have for <b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"342\">SAS and SCSI drive server recovery Sharjah</b>, and it&#8217;s why we can save drives that other shops can&#8217;t.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"15\">24/7 Server Data Recovery Industrial Area Sharjah: We Do It All</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Since Sharjah has so many different types of businesses, everyone uses different computers. We have bought the best tools to talk to almost any server, whether it&#8217;s 10 years old or a super-fast new one.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Windows and Linux Experts</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">We do <b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"6\">Windows Server data recovery Sharjah</b> for everything from the old 2008 versions to the newest ones. Our guys are also great at <b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"132\">Linux/UNIX server recovery Industrial Area</b>, handling all types of file systems like EXT4 or XFS. We know how to put &#8220;LVM&#8221; volumes back together even if the main settings are totally scrambled.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"19\">NAS and SAN Storage Fixes</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">Whether your data is on a Synology NAS box or a big enterprise SAN from Dell or NetApp, we can get it. We pull the data out at a &#8220;block level,&#8221; which means we go around the hardware errors to read the raw info directly from the disks. Often, this is the only way to save a failing system.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"21\">Our Simple Process Getting You Back Online</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">We know that for a business, being fast is a must. Here is how we do it:</p>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"23\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Quick Start:</b> Our 24/7 phone line is always open. we can pick up your server from <b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"81\">Sajja</b>, <b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">Maliha Road</b>, or anywhere else in Sharjah.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Check-up:</b> In just a few hours, we find out if it&#8217;s a hardware break or a software error.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Making a &#8220;Ghost&#8221; Copy:</b> We never work on your original drives. We make a 100% exact copy first to keep your data safe.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rebuilding:</b> Our engineers manually fix the RAID and repair the files to get your data out.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">You Check It:</b> We show you a list of all the files we found. You check your critical databases first so you know it&#8217;s a success.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"24\">A Real Story: Fixing a SQL Database in 36 Hours</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25\">A factory in <b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"13\">Industrial Area 6</b> had their RAID 5 server crash when two drives died at the same time. This server held all their production orders. Their local IT tried to fix it but made it worse, and the database wouldn&#8217;t open.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26\">They called us for <b data-path-to-node=\"26\" data-index-in-node=\"19\">emergency server reconstruction Sharjah</b>. Our team worked all night fixing the drives in the clean room and manually fixing the RAID settings. We did a full <b data-path-to-node=\"26\" data-index-in-node=\"175\">SQL database recovery Sharjah Industrial Area</b> and gave it back in 36 hours. The factory was able to start shipping again on Monday morning with no data lost at all!</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"27\">Common Questions About Sharjah Server Recovery</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How much does it cost?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28\">It depends on how many drives you have and what&#8217;s broken. We always do a free check and give you a fixed price. If we can&#8217;t get your data, you don&#8217;t pay the recovery fee.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"29\"><b data-path-to-node=\"29\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How fast is the emergency service?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"29\">For emergencies, our guys work day and night. Most jobs are done in 24 to 48 hours.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can you save a server that won&#8217;t boot up?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\">Yes, definitely. Usually, that just means the &#8220;start-up&#8221;