sical disks inside are broken. If a drive is clicking, it has to be opened in a sterile room with zero dust. Our ISO-certified Cleanroom makes sure we can swap parts inside the drive safely so we can read the data again.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\">We Make a Safe Copy First</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14\">We never work on your original drives directly. The first thing we do is make a 100% perfect clone of every disk. This way, your original data stays untouched and safe while we do the math to rebuild the files on our own computers.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\">Smart Math for Better Recovery</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">RAID recovery is basically a huge math problem. Our engineers use special software to figure out the drive order and how the data was spread out. Whether it&#8217;s <b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"159\">RAID 10 data retrieval Sharjah</b> or a big RAID</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">we can usually rebuild it without needing your original server hardware.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"18\">We Support All Kinds of RAID in Al Nahda</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">Storage tech changes all the time, and we stay ready. We offer <b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"63\">RAID reconstruction services Al Nahda</b> for any setup, brand, or operating system. Every system is a bit different, and our team knows the &#8220;secret language&#8221; of each one.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\">Standard RAID 0, 1, 5, 6, and 10</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">From the super fast RAID 0 to the safer RAID 6, we know how they work. We are really good at <b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"93\">RAID 6 recovery Al Nahda</b>, where we can get data back even if two drives are totally dead.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"22\">Big Server Brands (Dell, HP, IBM)</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">We have worked on hundreds of Dell PowerEdge and HP ProLiant servers. We know how their controllers handle data, which helps 