d use our own formulas to put your folders and files back together. You just won&#8217;t find this kind of service at a normal <b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"360\">data recovery shop Dubai Silicon Oasis</b>.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Strict Confidentiality &amp; Data Protection Protocols</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Your files never leave our safe network. We really understand the privacy needs of our clients here in Silicon Oasis. Every job is handled with a very strict &#8220;chain of custody.&#8221; Once you check that your data is all there, we give it back to you on a secure, encrypted drive. Then, we completely wipe our working copies so no trace is left behind.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Specialized Micro SD Card Recovery for Every Device</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">Memory cards come in all kinds of shapes, and each one needs a different expert touch. Our lab can handle all the flash media used in gadgets across the UAE today.</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"19\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Professional DSLR &amp; Mirrorless Cards:</b> Fancy cameras like Sony or Canon use complicated ways to save 4K and 8K video. If the card is pulled out while the camera is still saving, the files get messed up. We specialize in fixing these video files so they play perfectly again.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Micro SD for Drones and Action Cams:</b> Drones in the Dubai Digital Park often have &#8220;rough landings.&#8221; This can crack the inside of a MicroSD card. Our team uses special &#8220;spider&#8221; boards to tap into the card’s circuits and save the video.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mobile Phone &amp; Tablet Memory:</b> When a phone&#8217;s SD card dies, the data is usually encrypted (locked). We are