ools to find those &#8220;hidden&#8221; files and put them back together.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Controller Chip Failure:</b> If your Mac or PC says &#8220;Card Not Initialized,&#8221; the &#8220;brain&#8221; of the card is probably dead. We have to bypass it to talk to the memory directly.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sudden Power Loss:</b> If you pull the card out while the camera is still saving, it causes <b data-path-to-node=\"5,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">Corrupted SD Card Data Recovery JLT</b>, making files unreadable.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">File System Corruption:</b> Not &#8220;ejecting&#8221; properly from your laptop can turn the card into a &#8220;RAW&#8221; format that nothing can open.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,7,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,7,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Viruses and Malware:</b> Some bad software can hide your mobile files or lock them up and ask for money.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,8,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,8,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">NAND Flash Wear-out:</b> Every card has a life span. If you use it in a CCTV or dashcam every day, eventually the chips just give up.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5,9,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5,9,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Environmental Damage:</b> The humidity in the UAE or getting some salt water on it at the beach can cause rust inside the card.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Why Recovery Data is the Top Choice for SD Card Recovery Jumeirah Lake Towers</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Lots of small shops in Dubai say they do data recovery, but they often just use free software that can actually make things worse. <b data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"131\">Recovery Data</b> is a