y means the motor is stuck or the &#8220;heads&#8221; are glued to the disk. We can unstick them without losing your files.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dead External Hard Drive Repair Sharjah:</b> We fix drives that won&#8217;t turn on because of power spikes or broken USB plugs.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Recover Data from Dropped Hard Disk Sharjah:</b> If you dropped your drive, the parts inside might have moved. We realign them so the data can be read again.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corrupted HDD File Retrieval Rolla:</b> Sometimes the drive spins fine but the files are &#8220;scrambled.&#8221; We use special scanners to find them.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accidental Deleting:</b> Did you format the wrong drive? We can often &#8220;undo&#8221; that as long as you haven&#8217;t saved new stuff over it.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Electronic and Firmware Failure:</b> Sometimes the &#8220;brain&#8221; of the drive fails. We can fix the circuit board or the software inside the drive to get it working again.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Our Super Clean Lab for Sharjah Residents</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">One thing you should know: you should never open a hard drive on a normal table. Even a tiny speck of dust is like a big rock to a spinning drive. That’s why <b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"158\">Recovery Data</b> has an ISO-certified &#8220;Class 100 Cleanroom.&#8221; When you bring us your <b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"239\">Hard Disk Repair Near Rolla Clock Tower</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">job, we handle it in a room that is cleaner than a hospital surgery room.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">We use the same professional tools that the police and big global companies use. This is why we are different from the small repair shops in Rolla Square. We treat every drive like a special project, making sure your privacy is kept safe while we work to get your data back.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\">All Kinds of Hard Drive Services in Rolla</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">We help everyone, from students at the university to big factories. No matter how big or small your problem is, we have a way to fix it.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\">Laptop and Desktop Drive Help</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">Most laptops still use those spinning SATA drives. When they fail, you lose your whole computer. Our engineers are great at fixing these, making a perfect copy of your data before we even start the final repair.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\">Fixing Dead External Drives</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">Everyone has a portable drive like a WD My Passport or Seagate. Since these move around a lot, they break easily. Even if the USB port snapped off or the drive won&#8217;t spin, our <b data-path-to-node=\"19\" data-index-in-node=\"176\">Dead External Hard Drive Repair Sharjah</b> team can usually get those files out.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"20\">Server and RAID Help for Businesses</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">For shops in the Rolla district, losing your server means your business stops. We offer fast help for RAID systems. If one or two drives fail, we can rebuild the whole thing so you can get back to work without losing your customer lists or accounts.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"22\">New SSD and Hybrid Drive Fixes</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">A lot of people now use SSDs because they are fast. They don&#8217;t have moving parts, but the chips inside can still &#8220;burn out.&#8221; We use special technology to read the data directly from the memory chips.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"25\">Our Simple 4-Step Process</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26\">We don&#8217;t like to make things complicated. Here is how we get your data back:</p>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"27\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Free Talk and Pickup:</b> We can talk about your problem for free, and we can even pick up your drive from the Rolla Clock Tower area or anywhere in Sharjah.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Checkup:</b> Within a day, we tell you exactly what’s wrong and give you a price that won&#8217;t change. No hidden costs here!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Lab Work:</b> Once you say &#8220;go,&#8221; we start the repair in our lab. We might have to change parts or fix the software on the drive.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Checking and Return:</b> We show you a list of your files so you know we got them. Then, we put them on a new drive and send it back to you.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"29\">Helping the People of Rolla</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\">Rolla is the heart of Sharjah, and we love being part of this community. From the small shops in Al Ghuwair to the students living nearby, we are proud to be the <b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"162\">Best Data Recovery Lab in Rolla</b>. We know that for a shop owner, losing a database is a huge disaster.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\">We are here to make sure that doesn&#8217;t happen. By using the best technology, we help keep our neighbors&#8217; memories and businesses safe.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"32\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"33\">1. How much does it cost to fix a clicking drive?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34\">The price for <b data-path-to-node=\"34\" data-index-in-node=\"14\">Clicking Hard Drive Recovery Rolla</b> depends on what parts we need to buy to fix it. We give you a free check first, and if we can&#8217;t get the data, you don&#8217;t pay anything.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"35\">2. Can you fix a beeping drive without losing my files?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"36\">Yes, usually! Beeping means something is stuck. If we catch it early, we can unstick it and get your files out safely.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"37\">3. Can you fix an external drive that doesn&#8217;t spin?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"38\">Yes. If it’s not spinning, it’s probably a power problem or a dead motor. Our <b data-path-to-node=\"38\" data-index-in-node=\"78\">Dead External Hard Drive Repair Sharjah</b> experts can usually swap the parts to get it moving again.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"39\">4. What if my files just disappeared?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"40\">That sounds like <b data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"17\">Corrupted HDD File Retrieval Rolla</b>. Sometimes the drive is &#8220;confused.&#8221; We use special tools to find the hidden files and bring them back.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"41\">5. What if I dropped my drive and the case is broken?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"42\">The plastic case doesn&#8217;t matter much. As long as the metal drive inside isn&#8217;t open, there is a very good chance we can <b data-path-to-node=\"42\" data-index-in-node=\"119\">Recover Data from Dropped Hard Disk Sharjah</b>.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"43\">6. How long does it take?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"44\">Most jobs take about 3 to 5 days. But if you are in a huge rush, we have an emergency service that can get it done in 24 to 48 hours.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"46\">Get Your Data Back Today  Contact Us</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"47\">Don&#8217;t let a broken drive ruin your week. At <a href=\"https://recoverydata.ae/#\"><b data-path-to-node=\"47\" data-index-in-node=\"44\">Recovery Data</b></a>, we have the right tools and the experience to fix any hard drive disaster. Whether you need the <b data-path-to-node=\"47\" data-index-in-node=\"155\">Best Data Recovery Lab in Rolla</b> or just some advice on a <b data-path-to-node=\"47\" data-index-in-node=\"212\">Hard Disk Repair Near Rolla Clock Tower</b>, we are ready to help.</p>\n','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hard-Drive-Recovery-Rolla.jpg','published','2026-03-04 05:16:46','Hard Drive Recovery Rolla +971564101040','Hard Drive Recovery Rolla by Lifeguard experts. Recover lost HDD data fast from damaged or failed drives. call now +971564101040',NULL,'https://recoverydata.ae/hard-drive-recovery-rolla/','Hard Drive Recovery Rolla +971564101040','Hard Drive Recovery Rolla by Lifeguard experts. Recover lost HDD data fast from damaged or failed drives. call now +971564101040','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hard-Drive-Recovery-Rolla.jpg',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-10-12 04:19:53','2026-10-12 04:19:53'),(283,1,'RAID Recovery JLT','raid-recovery-jlt','Professional RAID Recovery JLT Expert Data Restoration for Jumeirah Lake Towers Losing data on a RAID array isn’t just a simple technical glitch for a business working in the busy office clusters of JLT, it feels like a total race against timeMaybe it’s a huge SQL database for your online shop or years of old […]\n','<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_60becf4ea8974d87\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel enable-updated-hr-color\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-busy=\"false\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Professional RAID Recovery JLT Expert Data Restoration for Jumeirah Lake Towers Losing data on a RAID array isn&#8217;t just a simple technical glitch for a business working in the busy office clusters of JLT, it feels like a total race against timeMaybe it&#8217;s a huge SQL database for your online shop or years of old project files either way,</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">RAID is a bit tricky. One small mistake while trying to &#8220;rebuild&#8221; the system can mean your data is gone forever At <a href=\"https://recoverydata.ae/#\"><b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"376\">Recovery Data</b></a>, we’ve got the engineering skills to fix these complex systems. If you&#8217;re stuck with a <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"477\">failed RAID array recovery JLT</b> situation right now, the best thing you can do is just turn the power off and talk to a</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">professional who knows what they&#8217;re doing.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Why RAID Failure is such a Big Deal for Dubai Businesses</h2>\n<p id=\"p-rc_36364bfb87fec3a4-19\" data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span class=\"citation-5 citation-end-5\">Deep in the heart of Dubai, JLT is a huge spot for global trade and local startups.</span> Most offices here use some kind of NAS or SAN storage to keep their work running smoothly. When these systems go down, everything just stops.We totally understand the pressure JLT companies are under, so our lab is always ready to handle even the</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">mostcomplicated setups. Our way of doing <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"374\">RAID Recovery JLT</b> uses special tools and hardware repairs to get your business back on track fast.We don&#8217;t just run software; we actually understand how the data is saved deep inside the disks.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"6\">Solutions for Every Kind of RAID Setup</h2>\n<p id=\"p-rc_36364bfb87fec3a4-20\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span class=\"citation-4 citation-end-4\">Not all RAID levels work the same way, so they shouldn&#8217;t be fixed the same way either.</span> A &#8220;quick fix&#8221; software you find online usually won&#8217;t work because it doesn&#8217;t understand the specific way your controller saved the data. Here is how we handle the different types:</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Precision RAID 1 Recovery JLT</h3>\n<p id=\"p-rc_36364bfb87fec3a4-21\" data-path-to-node=\"9\"><span class=\"citation-3 citation-end-3\">RAID 1 is supposed to be safe because it &#8220;mirrors&#8221; your data, meaning you have two copies.</span> But things go wrong when both drives fail at the same time or a controller error messes up both disks at once.Our <b data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"206\">RAID 1 Recovery JLT</b> service focuses on making a perfect copy of the healthy parts so your files are synced and working again. We</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">make sure the &#8220;mirror&#8221; is perfectly rebuilt so you don&#8217;t lose a single file.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Specialized RAID 5 Recovery JLT</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">A lot of small businesses in JLT use RAID 5 because it’s fast and usually safe. It can survive one drive breaking, but it’s actually very risky if a second drive starts having problems while you&#8217;re trying to fix the first one.This happens more than you think! Our team is great at <b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"282\">RAID 5 Recovery JLT</b>, using manual techniques to put the</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">data back together even if the &#8220;parity&#8221; info (that’s the math that keeps the data safe) is a bit of a mess.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">High-Capacity RAID 6 and RAID 10 Restoration</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">For bigger companies running really important apps, RAID 6 and 10 give more protection. Fixing these takes a deep understanding of how the data is spread out across many disks. We do <b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"183\">RAID 6 Recovery JLT</b> and <b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"207\">RAID 10 Recovery JLT </b>by making a &#8220;virtual&#8221; version of your hardware in our lab. This way, we can get the data out</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">without hurting your actual disks anymore. It is a much safer way to work.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Common RAID Problems We Fix for Our Clients</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Because these systems are complex, failures can happen from the hardware, the software, or just a simple human mistake. Here is what we see most often in JLT:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">RAID Controller Failure Recovery JLT:</b> If the controller card dies, the drives &#8220;forget&#8221; how to talk to each other. It&#8217;s like losing the map to a city. We skip the controller and rebuild the map ourselves.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Too Many Failed Drives:</b> This is the nightmare scenario where more disks break than the system can handle. Even then, we can usually save it.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accidental Changes:</b> Someone accidentally clicks the wrong button while trying to move data or &#8220;initialize&#8221; the disk and wipes the whole thing. Don&#8217;t worry, it happens to the best of us.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">NAS RAID Recovery JLT:</b> We see a lot of Synology, QNAP, or Asustor boxes from home offices in JLT that have logic errors or firmware bugs.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Power and Heat Issues:</b> Sometimes the Dubai heat or a sudden power surge can fry the circuit boards inside the server. Since JLT towers are big, sometimes cooling fails and the drives get too hot.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Failed Rebuilds:</b> This is when you put a new drive in, and the system tries to fix itself but crashes halfway. This is very dangerous for your data.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Our Simple and Transparent Recovery Steps</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">We believe in being honest about how we work. When you give <b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"60\">Recovery Data</b> your server or NAS, we follow a strict plan to keep your info safe. You’re never in the dark about what’s happening.</p>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"19\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Quick Diagnostic:</b> After we get your media, we check it out to see what&#8217;s actually wrong and how much we can save. We tell you the price upfront.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Making Safe Copies:</b> We never work on your original drives directly because that&#8217;s too risky. We make exact bit-by-bit clones so the originals stay safe and untouched.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Virtual Rebuilding:</b> Our engineers manually figure out the &#8220;stripe size&#8221; and &#8220;parity&#8221; to rebuild the array in a safe virtual space on our own servers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">You Check the Files:</b> This is the best part. We show you a list of the files we found. You can check if your most important folders are there before you pay us anything.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Secure Data Return:</b> Once you&#8217;re happy, we send your data back on a brand new secure drive or via a private, encrypted download link if it’s not too big.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"20\">Why JLT Offices Pick &#8220;Recovery Data&#8221;</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">Choosing a partner in Dubai means looking for real experience, not just a fancy website. At Recovery Data, we offer a &#8220;No Data, No Fee&#8221; promise. This means we only get paid if we actually get your files back.If we can&#8217;t save your data, you don&#8217;t owe us for the service. It makes things fair, right?Our lab has special &#8220;Cleanrooms&#8221; that are</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">kept super tidy. This is important because even a tiny bit of dust can ruin a hard drive if it&#8217;s opened.Also, since we are located so close to Jumeirah Lake Towers, we can pick up your drives really fast sometimes in less than an hour. This is great for <b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"297\">Emergency RAID Recovery JLT</b> when youhave a deadline and can&#8217;t afford to wait. We</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">also offer <b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"390\">24/7 RAID Recovery JLT</b> for those &#8220;middle of the night&#8221; emergencies.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"26\">Pricing and How Long it Honestly Takes</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">We get asked about price a lot. To be honest, it depends on how many drives you have and what actually broke. A <b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">RAID Server Recovery JLT</b> for a 12-drive server is more work than a 2-drive NAS.We try to keep our prices fair for the UAE market, but we always say: be careful of &#8220;cheap&#8221; services. Some shops use cheap software that</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">can actually overwrite your data, making it gone forever.We’ll give you a clear price after the first checkup, so there are no surprises or hidden costs. Usually, a standard recovery takes about 3 to 5 days. If you&#8217;re in a huge rush, we have an emergency service that works around the clock to get it done in 24 hours.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"29\">Some Questions People Ask Us (FAQ)</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q1: Can you get data back if the RAID controller is physically burnt?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\">Yes, definitely. For <b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"91\">RAID Controller Failure Recovery JLT</b>, we don&#8217;t actually need the old controller card. We use our own special software to act like the controller and &#8220;read&#8221; the data from the drives directly.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q2: How do I know which drive is the broken one in my RAID 5?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\">Most NAS boxes (like QNAP or Synology) will show a red light or send you an email alert. But if the whole system is dead and you can&#8217;t see the lights, don&#8217;t start pulling drives out randomly! That can make the recovery harder. Let us check it properly with our tools first.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32\"><b data-path-to-node=\"32\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q3: Is RAID 0 recovery even possible?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32\">RAID 0 is tough because it doesn&#8217;t have any backup copy (no redundancy). But as long as the physical drives can be fixed, we can usually get the data back. We just need to be able to read every single drive in the set to put the &#8220;puzzle&#8221; back together.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"33\"><b data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q4: Do you come to my office in JLT to fix it?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"33\">We offer pickup from any JLT Cluster (like Cluster W, Cluster J, etc.). But for the actual work, we usually need to bring the drives to our lab. It’s because our lab is dust-free and has all the heavy machines we need for the repair. It’s much safer for your data that way.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34\"><b data-path-to-node=\"34\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q5: What if I hear a clicking or grinding sound from the server?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34\">Stop everything and turn it off! A clicking sound means the &#8220;head&#8221; inside the drive is hitting the disk.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"35\"><b data-path-to-node=\"35\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q6: Can you help with Hard Drive Data Recovery in Dubai for normal laptops too?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"35\">Yes, we do that too! While we specialize in big RAID systems, we help plenty of people in Dubai with their personal laptops, external USB drives, and even SSDs.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"36\">Get Your Data Back Today</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"37\">Don’t let a broken server or a failed NAS ruin your business or your week. Whether it’s a <a href=\"https://recoverydata.ae/\"><b data-path-to-node=\"37\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">NAS RAID Recovery JLT</b></a> or a complex enterprise server crash, the team at Recovery Data has seen it all before. We have the right tools, the right lab, and a friendly team ready to help you.</p>\n</div>\n','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/RAID-Recovery-JLT.jpg','published','2026-03-04 05:13:25','RAID Recovery JLT - +971564101040','RAID Recovery JLT by Lifeguard experts. Restore lost RAID data fast & safely. Free diagnosis, quick turnaround. call now +971564101040',NULL,'https://recoverydata.ae/raid-recovery-jlt/','RAID Recovery JLT - +971564101040','RAID Recovery JLT by Lifeguard experts. Restore lost RAID data fast & safely. Free diagnosis, quick turnaround. call now +971564101040','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/RAID-Recovery-JLT.jpg',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-10-12 04:19:53','2026-10-12 04:19:53'),(284,1,'Data Recovery Rolla','data-recovery-rolla','Losing your digital files is honestly such a nightmare, and it always seems to happen at the worst time possible. Whether it’s ten years of family photos, a big project for university, or the important accounts for your business, that panic when a drive fails is really scary. At Recovery Data, we are here to […]\n','<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Losing your digital files is honestly such a nightmare, and it always seems to happen at the worst time possible