ve. You can pick it up or we can send it by courier directly to your JLT office.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"45\">Same-Day NVMe Recovery JLT: Serving Jumeirah Lake Towers Clusters</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\">Time is very important for JLT professionals. Because we are right here in the heart of Jumeirah Lake Towers, we are very fast. You don&#8217;t have to wait for days for a package. We offer 60-minute pickup from any Cluster from Ato Z! For emergencies, we can often finish the check-up and start the recovery on the same day.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\">Being local means we can talk to you face-to-face, which is much better than dealing with a company far away.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"48\">FAQs Everything You Need to Know About NVMe SSD Recovery JLT</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"49\"><b data-path-to-node=\"49\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Is it harder to get data from an NVMe drive than a SATA SSD?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"49\">Yes, quite a bit harder. NVMe is much faster and more complex. It uses different tech that needs special gear to bypass the broken parts.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"50\"><b data-path-to-node=\"50\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How much does it cost?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"50\">The price depends on what&#8217;s wrong. Simple file errors are cheaper, but if the internal software or chips are broken, it takes more work. We’ll always give you a fixed quote after the free check.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"51\"><b data-path-to-node=\"51\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can you save data from a water-damaged NVMe?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"51\">Yes. We use special cleaning to get the rust off the board and then fix the broken parts to make it read again.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"52\"><b data-path-to-node=\"52\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">What is the success rate?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"52\">Our success rate is one of the highest in the UAE—over 90% as long as the main chips aren&#8217;t physically cracked.</p>\