21; to get back.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Your Privacy is Safe with Us</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">We know your phone has all your private stuff  from bank details to personal chats. Keeping your info safe is our top priority. At Recovery Data, we handle every phone with very strict privacy rules. We are happy to sign an NDA (Non-Disclosure Agreement) if you need it.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Your data is recovered on safe, offline systems and we never keep it longer than we need to, so your personal life stays private.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">High Success for Encrypted iPhones and Androids</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Modern phones use very tough encryption to keep things secure. This is great for safety, but it makes recovery a nightmare when the system fails. Our team stays updated on all the latest ways to get past these locks on the newest iOS and Android versions.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Whether it&#8217;s a FileVault lock or a corrupted system, we have the tools to get through those walls and give you back your files in a way you can actually use them.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Specialized Data Retrieval for All Modern Smartphones</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Our lab is set up to handle almost every brand out there. We have the specific tools and codes for every major maker.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"16\">iPhone Data Recovery Sharjah Specialists</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">Whether it&#8217;s the newest iPhone 15 or 16, or even an old one from years ago, we are the experts for <b data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"99\">iPhone recovery near Al Majaz Waterfront</b>. We fix things like the &#8220;Apple Logo Loop&#8221; or &#8220;Disabled iPhone&#8221; messages.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\">Because Apple parts are all connected in a special way, our ability to do micro-soldering on the board is often the only way to save the data.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\">Android Data Recov