h-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"197\">This is why</b> we can often get data back <b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"236\">even when</b> other shops say it is &#8220;impossible.&#8221; <b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"282\">Basically</b>, we can rebuild the data map from scratch.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"20\">Expert Solid State Drive Recovery: We Handle Everything</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"21\">The world of SSDs is big, <b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"26\">ranging from</b> the small ones in old laptops to the super fast ones in new computers. <b data-path-to-node=\"21\" data-index-in-node=\"110\">Fortunately</b>, our lab can handle all of them without any problem.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"22\">NVMe and M.2 SSD Recovery</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">Newer NVMe drives are incredibly fast, <b data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">but</b> they are a bit of a pain to recover. <b data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">Specifically</b>, they talk directly to the computer&#8217;s CPU. Our team are experts at getting data from failed NVMe and M.2 drives, <b data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"206\">including</b> the ones with special plugs found in some expensive laptops. <b data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"277\">So</b>, don&#8217;t worry if your drive looks different than a standard one.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"24\">Business and Server Storage</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25\"><b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">For companies</b> in the <b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"21\">Mussafah Industrial Area</b>, when a server goes down, you lose money every minute. <b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"101\">To address this</b>, we provide emergency <b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"139\">SSD recovery ICAD Mussafah</b> for big server systems. <b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"190\">In fact</b>, we know how these complex systems work and can find your files <b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"262\">even in</b> huge commercial storage setups. <b data-path-to-node=\"25\" data-index-in-node=\"302\">As a result</b>, your downtime is kept to a minimum.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"26\">External and Portable SSDs</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">Portable drives are easy to drop or break the USB port. <b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"56\">Consequently</b>, we often do <b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"82\">SSD repair Mussafah M1</b> for photographers and engineers who use external drives. <b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"162\">In many cases</b>, we can go around the broken plugs and get the data straight from the internal chips. <b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"262\">Regardless</b> of the damage, we usually have a solution.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"29\">Problems We Fix Every Single Day</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\">Finding out why it failed is the first step. <b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">At Recovery Data</b>, we see a few main types of problems:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"31\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Firmware Glitches:</b> The drive gets &#8220;locked&#8221; or shows the wrong size. <b data-path-to-node=\"31,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">Usually</b>, this happens after a power cut.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Controller Failure:</b> The electronic brain is dead. <b data-path-to-node=\"31,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">Consequently</b>, the computer won&#8217;t even see the drive exists.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Power Damage:</b> Blown parts from electricity jumps. <b data-path-to-node=\"31,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"50\">To fix this</b>, we do tiny <b data-path-to-node=\"31,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">SSD repair Mussafah M2</b> to get the power back.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Logical Mistakes:</b> Accidental formatting or viruses. <b data-path-to-node=\"31,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"52\">While</b> the hardware is fine, the files are messed up.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Old Age:</b> Memory chips can actually wear out <b data-path-to-node=\"31,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"44\">over time</b>. <b data-path-to-node=\"31,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"55\">Therefore</b>, we use smart software to &#8220;carve&#8221; the data out.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"33\">Our Simple 4-Step Plan to Get Your Data</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34\">We like to be very clear about how we work <b data-path-to-node=\"34\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">so</b> you don&#8217;t have to worry. <b data-path-to-node=\"34\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">Essentially</b>, we follow a proven path to success.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"35\"> Free Check and Pickup</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"36\">Looking for <b data-path-to-node=\"36\" data-index-in-node=\"12\">SSD data recovery near me Mussafah</b>? <b data-path-to-node=\"36\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">Well</b>, we make it easy. We give you a free first check-up and can <b data-path-to-node=\"36\" data-index-in-node=\"113\">even</b> send a driver to pick up your drive from your office. <b data-path-to-node=\"36\" data-index-in-node=\"172\">In this way</b>, a professional handles it from the start.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"37\"> Report and Fixed Price</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"38\"><b data-path-to-node=\"38\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">After</b> we look at it in our lab, we give you a full report. <b data-path-to-node=\"38\" data-index-in-node=\"59\">Importantly</b>, we have a &#8220;No Data, No