h2 data-path-to-node=\"22\">Comprehensive iPhone Backup Recovery Dubai Marina</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">Sometimes the phone is okay, but the backup file is &#8220;broken&#8221; or corrupted. If iCloud or iTunes is giving you an error and won&#8217;t let you restore to your new phone,our <b data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"167\">iPhone backup recovery Dubai Marina</b> experts are here for you. We are good at pulling data out of encrypted or damaged backups that the normal Apple system just</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">can&#8217;t read. It’s a lifesaver for people who thought they were safe with a backup, only to find it doesn&#8217;t work when they need it most.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"25\">Physically Damaged &amp; Water Recovery: A Marina Specialty</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26\">Living near the water means we see a lot of &#8220;Salt Water&#8221; damage. If your iPhone took a dip in the Marina or the sea, the salt can eat away at the internal parts very fast Our <b data-path-to-node=\"26\" data-index-in-node=\"176\">iPhone Data Recovery Dubai Marina</b> lab is equipped with ultrasonic cleaners and micro soldering stations to fix these tiny parts.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26\">The most important thing is to <b data-path-to-node=\"26\" data-index-in-node=\"335\">never</b> put your phone in rice! It doesn&#8217;t work and can actually make the corrosion worse. Bring it to us while it&#8217;s still damp for the best chance of recovery.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"28\"> Data Recovery Process</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"29\">At Recovery Data, we like to keep things clear so you aren&#8217;t confused by all the tech talk. We treat your phone like our own.</p>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"30\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Free Talk:</b> Bring your phone to our Marina lab or we can send a courier to pick it up. We’ll ask what happened so we can find the best way 