l parts just enough so we can pull the data out safely. We don&#8217;t necessarily &#8220;fix&#8221; the phone to use again, but we fix it enough to get your files.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"45\"><b data-path-to-node=\"45\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q: How many days will it take?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"45\">A: Usually, it takes 2 to 5 business days. If you’re in a huge rush for a work deadline, we have an emergency service that takes only 24 hours.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\"><b data-path-to-node=\"46\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q: Do you need my passcode?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\">A: Yes, we do. Since Apple’s security is so strong, we need the code to unlock the data once we get inside the memory chips. Without it, the data stays scrambled.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"47\"><b data-path-to-node=\"47\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q: Is my data safe with you?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"47\">A: Privacy is our number one rule. Your files are only seen by the engineer working on them, and we delete everything from our system once you have your data back safely.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"48\"><b data-path-to-node=\"48\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Q: What if I dropped my iPhone in water?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"48\">A: We are experts at water damage! Just please don&#8217;t try to charge it or turn it on, because that can fry the insides. Bring it to us right away for the best chance.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"50\">Ready to Get Your Data Back?</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"51\">Don&#8217;t let a bit of bad luck lose your memories forever. Whether you need <b data-path-to-node=\"51\" data-index-in-node=\"73\"><a href=\"https://recoverydata.ae/\">iPhone video recovery Dubai</a> Marina</b> or help with a broken backup, we are ready and waiting to help you out. We know how much your data means to you, and we won&#8217;t stop until we&#8217;ve tried everything.</p>\n</div>\n','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/20-5.jpg','pub