e found that two of the &#8220;failed&#8221; drives had suffered electronic failures due to a power surge. We performed component-level repairs to the PCBs, successfully imaged the drives, and manually reconstructed the array. Within 48 hours, we returned 100% of the SQL database, allowing the firm to resume operations and avoid massive contractual penalties. This success story highlights the value of local, specialized expertise in a crisis.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"43\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"44\">Can you recover data if multiple drives have failed in a RAID array?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"45\">Yes. While a RAID array has built-in redundancy, it can only handle a specific number of failures. As specialists, we can often recover data even when the number of failed drives exceeds the array&#8217;s fault tolerance by physically repairing the drives and manually reconstructing the parity.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"46\">How long does the Server Recovery Dubai Investment Park process take?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"47\">Most standard server recoveries are completed within 3 to 5 business days. However, for critical business emergencies in DIP, we offer a priority 24/7 service that can often deliver results within 24 to 48 hours.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"48\">Is it safe to try and rebuild the RAID before calling a specialist?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"49\">We strongly advise against it. If there is an underlying hardware issue, a rebuild puts immense stress on the remaining drives, which can lead to secondary failures and permanent data loss.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"50\">What is the cost of Server Hard Drive Recovery Dubai Investment Park?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"51\">The cost varies based on the complexity of the case. We provide a fixed-price quote after our free diagnostic so you know exactly what to expect before we begin the recovery.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"54\">How is my recovered server data de