top by our Al Barsha 2 lab. We can even pick up and drop off your Mac anywhere in Dubai.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Check-up:</b> Within 24 hours, our techies look deep into your Mac to see what’s wrong and give you a guaranteed price.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Fix:</b> We do the hard work in our secure lab to copy your data safely.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Get it Back:</b> You come in and check your files. Once you’re happy, we put them on a new drive and give it back to you.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"36\">Frequently Asked Questions About Mac Data Recovery</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"37\"><b data-path-to-node=\"37\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How much does MacBook data recovery cost in Dubai?</b> It depends on how bad the damage is. We offer <b data-path-to-node=\"37\" data-index-in-node=\"97\">affordable Mac data recovery in Al Barsha</b> with a very clear price. We always start with a check-up and a fixed quote.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"38\"><b data-path-to-node=\"38\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can you get data from an M1 or M2 Mac that won&#8217;t turn on?</b> Yes, we can! We are experts in <b data-path-to-node=\"38\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">Mac SSD Data Recovery Dubai</b> for these new chips. We fix the board enough to &#8220;wake up&#8221; the storage and pull the data out.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"40\"><b data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Is it okay to use a free app to find my deleted files?</b> We don&#8217;t recommend it for Macs with SSDs. It can actually make the data disappear forever. For the best chance to <b data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"169\">recover deleted files MacBook Pro</b>, it’s better to turn it off and let a pro look at it.</p>\n<p data-path-to