ex-in-node=\"160\">Hard Drive Data Recovery in Dubai</b> is so good that even if you drop your laptop, we can usually save it.</p>\n<h6 data-path-to-node=\"22\">Specialized SSD, NVMe, and M.2 Retrieval</h6>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">Most new laptops, like a Dell XPS or a MacBook, use SSDs. These are much harder to fix than old drives. Our lab uses a method called &#8220;chip-off,&#8221; where we read the memory chips directly to get your photos and docs back.</p>\n<h6 data-path-to-node=\"24\">Apple MacBook Data Recovery (M1, M2, M3 Chips)</h6>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25\">New Macs are tricky because the storage is soldered onto the board. If you spill water on your MacBook Pro, we use tiny soldering tools to fix the shorts and pull the data straight from the Apple chips.</p>\n<h6 data-path-to-node=\"26\">External Media: USB, SD Cards, and Time Machine Backups</h6>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">If your backup drive stops working, we can help with <b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">external hard drive recovery,</b> too. We work with all brands like WD, Seagate, and Samsung to make sure your backups are healthy again.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"29\">Our Secure 4-Step Laptop Data Recovery Process</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\">We use a &#8220;safety-first&#8221; way of working, so your drive doesn&#8217;t get any worse while we have it.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"> Check-up:</b> We look at your laptop. Then, we give you a report and a fixed price for the job. No hidden costs.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Making a Clone:</b> We never work on your actual drive first. We make a perfect copy (a clone) of it. This keeps your original hardware safe from getting more tired.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Lab Work:</b> Our engineers work on that clone to fix