electronics sometimes just give up.</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"22\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Broken Hardware:</b> Small parts inside wearing out or breaking after a drop.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Liquid Damage:</b> We do a lot of <b data-path-to-node=\"22,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"30\">water damaged phone data recovery in Sharjah</b> for phones that took a swim in a pool.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">System Errors:</b> When the drive&#8217;s internal &#8220;brain&#8221; gets confused and your computer can&#8217;t see it anymore.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mistakes:</b> Accidentally deleting files or formatting your drive by mistake.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ransomware:</b> Helping businesses with <b data-path-to-node=\"22,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"36\">ransomware data recovery in Sharjah</b> to try and get files back after a hack.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Power Issues:</b> Fried parts caused by power spikes, which happens sometimes with faulty plugs.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"24\">Our Simple 4-Step Process</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25\">We believe in a &#8220;No Data, No Fee&#8221; promise. This makes it zero risk for you—you only pay if we actually get your important files back.</p>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"26\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"26,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Talk to Us:</b> Give us a call for a free chat. We can even pick up your device if you&#8217;re looking for <b data-path-to-node=\"26,0,0\" data-index-in-node