48 hours so you can get back to work.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"25\">Common Laptop Problems We Fix</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26\">Our Dubai Marina lab can handle almost any problem, from small software errors to a laptop that was dropped. If you see these things, please turn off your computer right away:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"27\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mechanical Hard Drive Failure:</b> Clicking, beeping, or grinding noises from the bottom of the laptop.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Failed SSD Controllers:</b> The laptop can&#8217;t find its own drive anymore because of a chip error.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Liquid Spills:</b> Coffee, tea, or juice on the keyboard, which causes parts to rust very fast.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Physical Damage:</b> When a laptop is dropped and the internal parts get misaligned.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accidental Deletion:</b> Getting files back after a &#8220;Factory Reset&#8221; or a mistake.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Corrupted Operating Systems:</b> When the laptop is stuck on a &#8220;Repairing&#8221; screen and you can&#8217;t get to your files.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"29\">4-Step Laptop Recovery Process</h2>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"30\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Check-up:</b> Bring your laptop to our lab or we can send a courier to pick it up in Dubai Marina. we do a safe check to see if the problem is physical or software.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<