covery Dubai Marina take?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"42\">Most checks are done in 8 hours or less. Usually, getting the data back takes 2 to 4 days, but we have a 24-hour emergency service if you&#8217;re in a big rush.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"43\"><b data-path-to-node=\"43\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can you fix an NVMe drive that won&#8217;t turn on?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"43\">Yes! If the board is burnt, we can either fix the circuit or take the memory chips off and read them in a special machine.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"44\"><b data-path-to-node=\"44\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Should I try a recovery program I found online?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"44\">Better not. If your NVMe has a physical problem, those programs will just keep trying to read it and might lock the drive forever or burn out the chips.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"45\"><b data-path-to-node=\"45\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Do you support the new MacBooks with the T2 or M-series chips?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"45\">Yes, we do. We have the latest forensic tools needed to handle the high security on the latest Apple computers in UAE.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\"><b data-path-to-node=\"46\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">What is the &#8220;No Data, No Fee&#8221; policy?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\">It means if we can&#8217;t get back the specific files your business needs, you don&#8217;t pay the service fee. It makes the whole thing risk-free for you.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"47\"><b data-path-to-node=\"47\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Are NVMe drives harder to fix than normal ones?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"47\">Yes, quite a bit. They are much faster and the way they store data is more complex, so you need much better lab gear to get into them.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"49\">Contact Your Dubai Marina NVMe Experts Now</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"50\">Don&#8217;t let a &#8220;Drive Not Found&#8221; error ruin your hard work. Whether it’s a <b data-path-to-node=\"50\" data-index-in-node=\"72\">failed NVMe SSD recovery Dubai Marina</b> or you just deleted something by mistake, the <a href=\"https://recoverydata.ae/\"><b data-path-to-node=\"50\" data-index-in-node=\"156\">Recovery Data</b></a> team has the skills and the local lab to help you out. We’re the top choice for fixing high-speed storage in the UAE.</p>\n</div>\n','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/5.jpg','published','2026-02-28 13:59:29','NVMe SSD Recovery Dubai Marina - +971564101040','Expert NVMe SSD Recovery Dubai Marina services for failed, corrupted or undetected drives. Fast, secure +971564101040',NULL,'https://recoverydata.ae/nvme-ssd-recovery-dubai-marina/','NVMe SSD Recovery Dubai Marina - +971564101040','Expert NVMe SSD Recovery Dubai Marina services for failed, corrupted or undetected drives. Fast, secure +971564101040','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/5.jpg',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-10-12 04:20:33','2026-10-12 04:20:33'),(472,1,'SSD Recovery Dubai Marina','ssd-recovery-dubai-marina','Professional Hard Drive Data Recovery in Dubai Expert Solutions for Critical Data LossIn the modern digital landscape, data is the lifeblood of both personal and professional spheres. From cherished family photographs and academic research to mission critical corporate databases and financial records, our lives are stored on spinning platters and flash chips. However, technology is […]\n','<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_2bdf5ad029734922\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel enable-updated-hr-color preserve-whitespaces-in-response\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-busy=\"false\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\">Professional Hard Drive Data Recovery in Dubai Expert Solutions for Critical Data LossIn the modern digital landscape, data is the lifeblood of both personal and professional spheres. From cherished family photographs and academic research to mission critical corporate databases and financial records, our lives are stored on</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\">spinning platters and flash chips. However, technology is never infallible.When a storage device fails, the resulting panic can be overwhelming. At <a href=\"https://www.recoverydata.ae\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"390\">Recovery Data</b></a>, we provide the most reliable and sophisticated <b data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"452\">hard drive data recovery in Dubai</b>, offering a lifeline to those facing the catastrophe of a failed storage system.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Losing access to your files is more than a technical glitch; it is a disruption of your life or business. Searching for <b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"120\">professional data recovery Dubai Marina</b> often happens during these moments of high stress. Whether your drive has suffered a mechanical crash, a liquid spill,</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">The Reality of Disk Failure Why Expert Intervention is Non-Negotiable</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span class=\"citation-42 citation-end-42\">A hard drive is a marvel of engineering, featuring read write heads that hover nanometers above spinning platters.</span> <span class=\"citation-41 citation-end-41\">Because the tolerances are so tight, any physical trauma a drop, a power surge, or even a microscopic speck of dust can lead to a &#8220;head crash.&#8221;</span> <span class=\"citation-40 citation-end-40\">When this happens, the drive often emits a clicking or beeping sound.</span></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><span class=\"citation-39\">If you encounter a </span><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"348\"><span class=\"citation-39\">failed SSD recovery Dubai Marina</span></b><span class=\"citation-39 citation-end-39\"> scenario or a clicking hard drive, the most critical step is to power down the device immediately.</span>Many users instinctively turn to free &#8220;cracked&#8221; recovery software found online. While software has its place for simple accidental deletions,</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">it can be fatal for a physically damaged drive. Software forces a failing drive to spin and read at high speeds, which can cause the damaged heads to scrape the magnetic coating off the platters, turning your data into dust. By choosing a specialist for <b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"396\">internal SSD recovery Dubai Marina</b> or HDD restoration,</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">you ensure your media is handled in a &#8220;read only&#8221; forensic environment, preventing further degradation.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Recovery Data Setting the Gold Standard in the UAE</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Trust is the most important factor when handing over a device containing sensitive information. Recovery Data has established itself as the leading provider in the region by prioritizing security, transparency, and technical excellence.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">ISO-Certified Security &amp; Confidentiality</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">We understand that the data we recover often contains highly sensitive corporate intellectual property or private personal information. Our laboratory follows strict ISO protocols for data handling. Every project we undertake is covered by a legally binding Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA),ensuring that your information remains</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">confidential from the moment it enters our facility in Dubai Marina until it is returned to you.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Certified Class 100 Cleanroom Environment</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">For mechanical repairs, a standard room is a hostile environment. A single grain of dust is like a mountain to a hard drive head. We perform all physical surgeries, such as head-stack replacements and platter swaps, inside a certified Class 100 Cleanroom. This sterile environment is essential for successful <b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"309\">hard drive recovery Dubai </b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"309\">Marina</b>, as it prevents contamination that would otherwise cause permanent data loss during the recovery process.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">No Data, No Fee: Our Risk-Free Guarantee</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">We believe that you should only pay for results. Our &#8220;No Data, No Fee&#8221; policy is a testament to our confidence and our commitment to our clients. If we are unable to recover the specific, critical files you need, you do not pay the recovery service fee. This makes our professional <b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"282\">laptop SSD recovery Dubai Marina</b> and</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">HDD services completely risk-free for individuals and businesses alike.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Comprehensive Recovery Services for Every Device</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">Our laboratory is equipped to handle the full spectrum of modern storage technology, ensuring that no matter how your data was lost, we have a pathway to bring it back.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"19\">Professional Hard Drive Recovery Dubai Marina (HDD)</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">Despite the rise of flash storage, high-capacity mechanical hard drives remain common in desktops and external backup units. Our <b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"129\">hard drive recovery Dubai Marina</b> specialists address common physical failures such as &#8220;seized spindles&#8221; and &#8220;stuck heads.&#8221; We maintain an extensive inventory of thousands of donor parts,</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">allowing us to perform repairs rapidly without waiting for international shipments.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"21\">Specialized SSD Data Recovery Dubai Marina</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\"><span class=\"citation-38 citation-end-38\">Solid State Drives represent a unique challenge due to their complex controller encryption and &#8220;TRIM&#8221; commands.</span> <span class=\"citation-37\">Whether you need </span><b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"129\"><span class=\"citation-37\">external SSD recovery Dubai Marina</span></b><span class=\"citation-37\"> after a portable drive was dropped or </span><b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"202\"><span class=\"citation-37\">internal SSD recovery Dubai Marina</span></b><span class=\"citation-37 citation-end-37\"> for a dead workstation, we use specialized hardware-firmware tools </span></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\"><span class=\"citation-37 citation-end-37\">like the PC-3000 Flash to communicate with the NAND chips directly, bypassing failed controllers.</span></p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"23\">Mission-Critical Server and RAID Recovery</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24\">For businesses in Dubai Marina, a server failure is a Tier-1 emergency. We specialize in <b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"89\">Server RAID recovery</b> (RAID 0, 1, 5, 6, 10), reconstructing complex striped and mirrored volumes. Our engineers work 24/7 on enterprise cases to ensure that business downtime is kept to an absolute minimum.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"26\">Common Failure Symptoms: Identifying the Problem</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">Understanding the symptoms of a failing drive can help you take the right action before it’s too late. Our <b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"107\">corrupted SSD recovery Dubai Marina</b> team frequently resolves the following issues:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"28\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\"><span class=\"citation-36\">The &#8220;Click of Death&#8221;:</span></b><span class=\"citation-36 citation-end-36\"> A rhythmic ticking sound indicating a mechanical failure of the read/write head assembly.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The &#8220;0MB&#8221; Error:</b><span class=\"citation-35 citation-end-35\"> The drive is detected by the computer, but it shows no capacity, usually a sign of firmware corruption.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Slow Performance &amp; Freezing:</b><span class=\"citation-34 citation-end-34\"> Frequent &#8220;hanging&#8221; while trying to open files often points to developing bad sectors or NAND flash wear-out.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Unformatted Drive Message:</b> The OS asks to format the drive because the partition table or file system has become corrupted.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dead/No Power:</b><span class=\"citation-33 citation-end-33\"> The device does not spin or show any lights, usually due to a failed PCB (Printed Circuit Board) or an electronic surge.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"30\">Our Secure 4-Step Recovery Process</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\">We have streamlined our workflow to be as transparent and efficient as possible for our Dubai-based clients:</p>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"32\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"32,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Consultation &amp; Intake:</b> You bring your device to our lab or schedule a secure courier pickup. We document the symptoms and provide an initial assessment.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"32,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Forensic Evaluation:</b> Within a few hours, our engineers perform a detailed diagnostic to determine the exact cause of failure and the probability of success. You receive a fixed-price quote.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"32,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Data Extraction:</b> Once you approve the quote, we move the drive to our Cleanroom or technical bench. we clone the drive at the bit-level and reconstruct the file system.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"32,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"32,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Verification &amp; Delivery:</b> You are provided with a file list to verify. Once confirmed, your recovered data is encrypted and transferred to a new secure drive for delivery.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"34\">Case Example Saving a Local Marketing Agency’s Portfolio</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"35\">Recently, a marketing firm located in Dubai Marina contacted us after their primary external work drive was accidentally dropped. The drive was beeping and wouldn&#8217;t mount, putting years of client portfolios at risk. This was a classic<b data-path-to-node=\"35\" data-index-in-node=\"235\">external SSD recovery Dubai Marina</b> emergency with a damaged controller and USB interface.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"35\"><span class=\"citation-32 citation-end-32\">Our team performed a &#8220;chip-off&#8221; recovery, reading the data directly from the NAND memory.</span> We successfully recovered 100% of the project files within 48 hours, allowing the agency to continue their operations without losing a single client asset.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"37\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"38\"><b data-path-to-node=\"38\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How much does data recovery in Dubai cost?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"38\">The cost depends on the type of failure (logical vs. physical) rather than the size of the drive. We provide a fixed quote after our free evaluation, so you know exactly what to expect.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"39\"><b data-path-to-node=\"39\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can you recover data from a laptop that won&#8217;t turn on?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"39\">Yes. We perform <b data-path-to-node=\"39\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">laptop SSD recovery Dubai Marina</b> by removing the internal storage and using specialized laboratory equipment to bypass the laptop&#8217;s power issues.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"40\"><b data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Is it possible to recover data after a drive has been formatted?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"40\">In many cases, yes. As long as you have not written a large amount of new data to the drive after the format, our <b data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"179\">corrupted SSD recovery Dubai Marina</b> tools can usually find the previous folder structure.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"41\"><b data-path-to-node=\"41\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How long does the recovery process take?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"41\">Standard cases are usually resolved in 2 4 business days. We also offer an Emergency service for critical business needs with a 24-hour turnaround.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"42\"><b data-path-to-node=\"42\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Is my data kept private?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"42\">Security is our top priority. We are an ISO-certified facility and provide NDAs for all clients. Your data is handled on air-gapped systems and is securely wiped from our servers once the project is closed.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"43\"><b data-path-to-node=\"43\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">What if my drive is clicking?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"43\">If your drive is clicking, it has a physical mechanical failure. You should turn it off immediately. Continued use can lead to &#8220;circular scoring&#8221; on the platters, making <b data-path-to-node=\"43\" data-index-in-node=\"200\">hard drive recovery Dubai Marina</b> impossible.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"45\">Contact the Dubai Marina Data Recovery Experts Now</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\">Don&#8217;t leave your important files to chance. Whether you are a student who lost a thesis, a family with lost vacation photos, or a corporation with a crashed server, <a href=\"https://recoverydata.ae/\"><b data-path-to-node=\"46\" data-index-in-node=\"165\">Recovery Data</b> </a>has the technology and the expertise to help. We are proud to be the most trusted name for <b data-path-to-node=\"46\" data-index-in-node=\"270\">hard drive data recovery in Dubai</b>,</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\">serving our community with integrity and a commitment to excellence</p>\n</div>\n','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/6.jpg','published','2026-02-28 13:44:05','SSD Recovery Dubai Marina - +971564101040','Expert SSD Recovery Dubai Marina services for failed, corrupted or formatted solid state drives. Fast, +971564101040',NULL,'https://recoverydata.ae/ssd-recovery-dubai-marina/','SSD Recovery Dubai Marina - +971564101040','Expert SSD Recovery Dubai Marina services for failed, corrupted or formatted solid state drives. Fast, +971564101040','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/6.jpg',1,NULL,0,0,'2026-10-12 04:20:33','2026-10-12 04:20:33'),(473,1,'RAID Recovery Dubai Marina','raid-recovery-dubai-marina','Professional Server RAID Recovery Dubai Marina We’ll Get Your Business Back Online Losing access to your main office server is a huge emergency that can basically stop your whole business from working. In a fast place like Dubai, data is what keeps everything moving, so when your storage fails, it feels like a total digital […]\n','<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_cfac679334f1f6fe\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel enable-updated-hr-color preserve-whitespaces-in-response\" dir=\"ltr\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-busy=\"false\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\">Professional Server RAID Recovery Dubai Marina We&#8217;ll Get Your Business Back Online Losing access to your main office server is a huge emergency that can basically stop your whole business from working. In a fast place like Dubai, data is what keeps everything moving, so when your storage fails, it feels like a total digital disaster.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\">At <a href=\"https://www.recoverydata.ae\"><b data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"256\">Recovery Data</b></a>, we provide the most expert <b data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"298\">Server RAID recovery Dubai Marina</b> has to offer. Our lab is built to handle those tricky multi-disk failures, making sure your databases and important company records come back safe. We handle everything with total privacy too.Whether you&#8217;re a big corporation in a Marina</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\">skyscraper or a smaller team in the heart of the district, our guys have the professional tools needed to rebuild your data from scratch. We know that looking for a <b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"210\">business RAID recovery service Dubai Marina</b> usually happens when you&#8217;re under a lot of stress.That’s why we combine real technical skill with a quick local response.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\">We’re experts at those complex &#8220;mirrored and striped&#8221; setups that most modern storage systems use.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"4\">Why Array Failure is a Big Deal You Need Real Pros</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">When a backup system like a RAID or a big NAS box stops working, most IT managers start looking for a <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"102\">NAS RAID recovery Dubai Marina</b> specialist.But the problem is, normal computer shops don&#8217;t usually have the &#8220;cleanroom&#8221; or the forensic tools needed to really fix it. A RAID crash isn&#8217;t a simple fix; it’s like a puzzle with</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">missing pieces. Trying to force a &#8220;rebuild&#8221; on a <b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"375\">failed RAID array recovery Dubai Marina</b> without expert help is how people lose data forever.The stress of trying to fix it often just kills the last healthy drives you have left.In these scary moments, picking a professional lab means your hardware is handled in a safe, &#8220;read-only&#8221;</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">way. We don&#8217;t mess with your original disks instead, we make perfect clones of every single drive.This keeps the system from overwriting your good data. Whether you&#8217;re dealing with a software-based <b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"305\">corrupted RAID recovery Dubai Marina</b> or a total mechanical collapse of your disks, our lab-grade process meets the highest</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">standards here in the United Arab Emirates.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"8\">Complete Solutions for Enterprise Storage</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Our lab can handle almost any modern server technology. No matter how your storage is set up, we have a way to bring your data back online.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">Specialized Server RAID Recovery Dubai Marina</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Modern servers use complex &#8220;brains&#8221; and software that normal technicians just can&#8217;t get into. Our <b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"98\">Server RAID recovery Dubai Marina</b> service fixes problems at the controller level, the physical disk level, and the software level. We work with all the big brands like Dell, HP, and IBM.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">We can even get data back from systems hit by huge power surges or board failures.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Enterprise RAID Data Recovery Dubai Marina</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">For big data centers, we offer specialized <b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"43\">enterprise RAID data recovery Dubai Marina</b>. We’re great at handling huge rackmount units and complex virtual systems like VMware. Whether your data loss is from a setup mistake or a total crash across many disks at once, we have the tools to rebuild the system virtually.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">This helps stop your company from losing money while everything is down.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">Business RAID Recovery Service Dubai Marina</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Small companies in Dubai Marina often use 2-bay or 4-bay NAS boxes for their files. Our <b data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">business RAID recovery service Dubai Marina</b> is made to be fast and secure, giving local owners the same expert help that big global companies get. We specialize in fixing &#8220;unmounted&#8221; volumes and &#8220;failed&#8221; errors on brands like</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">Synology and QNAP.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Our Simple Process: From Your Office to Your Data</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">We’ve made our workflow very smooth so it’s fast and safe for your expensive hardware:</p>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"19\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Hand over your drives:</b> You can bring your disks to our lab or we can send a courier to pick them up from your office in Dubai Marina.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Check-up:</b> In 4 to 8 hours, we’ll give you a full report and a fixed price for the job.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Repair:</b> Once you say yes, we do the work in our Cleanroom or use our software to rebuild the data.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Check and Delivery:</b> You get a file list to look at. Once you&#8217;re happy, we send the data back on a new, secure drive.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"21\">Common RAID Problems We Fix Every Day</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\">Our team knows how to find and fix almost any storage failure for our neighbors in Dubai Marina:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"23\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Too Many Fa