ath-to-node=\"49,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"49,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Emergency 24/7 Help:</b> If you need it back by tomorrow morning, we have a special team that works all night for an extra fee.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"51\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"52\">How much does RAID recovery cost in Al Quoz?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"53\">It depends on the damage, but most business jobs start around 2,500 AED. Remember, we have a &#8220;No Data, No Fee&#8221; policy, so you&#8217;re not risking your money.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"54\">Can you fix a RAID 5 if two drives died?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"55\">Yes, we can! Even though RAID 5 is only supposed to handle one dead drive, we can often repair the physical parts or use &#8220;math&#8221; to rebuild the missing pieces from the other disks.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"56\">How long does it take?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"57\">Usually, it takes 3 to 5 business days. But if it&#8217;s a huge emergency, our team can work 24/7 to get it done in just a day or two.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"58\">Do I need to bring the whole server?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"59\">Usually, we just need the hard drives. But if you can bring the controller card or the NAS box, it sometimes helps us work a bit faster.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"60\">Is my data safe and private?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"61\">Definitely. We use secure, offline computers and sign legal NDAs. Many big companies and government groups in Dubai trust us with their data.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"62\">What if my RAID rebuild fails?</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"63\">Stop right there! If it fails, it means another drive is probably dying. If you keep trying, you might lose everything. Turn it off and call a pro immediately.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"65\">Talk to Our Al Quoz RAID Recovery Experts</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"66\">Don&#8217;t leave your business&#8217;s future t