D recovery Al Quoz cost?</b> The price depends on what broke and if the drive is encrypted. Because SSDs need very special tools and engineering, we give you a price after a free check-up. We always give a fixed quote before we start.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"36\"><b data-path-to-node=\"36\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How long does the solid-state recovery process take?</b> Most SSD jobs take about 3 to 5 working days. If it is a huge emergency, we have a fast service that can do it in 24 to 48 hours depending on how bad the software damage is.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"37\"><b data-path-to-node=\"37\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Is it possible to recover deleted files from an SSD with TRIM enabled?</b> It is harder than an old hard drive because of the TRIM command. TRIM wipes the deleted blocks to keep the drive fast. But if you turn the drive off immediately after deleting something, we have a good chance to save the files.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"38\"><b data-path-to-node=\"38\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why is SSD recovery more complex than traditional hard disk repair?</b> Because data isn&#8217;t stored in a straight line on an SSD. It is spread across many chips using a &#8220;puzzle&#8221; algorithm. When the controller fails, the map for the puzzle is gone. Our engineers have to manually solve the puzzle to find your data.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"39\"><b data-path-to-node=\"39\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Do you offer a &#8220;No Data, No Fee&#8221; guarantee in Dubai?</b> Yes, definitely. At Recovery Data, we believe in our work. If we can&#8217;t get back the important files we talked about during the check-up, you don&#8217;t pay the recovery fee.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"41\">Start Your SSD Recovery Al Quoz Journey Today</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"42\">Don&#8217;t let a silent drive failure turn into a permanent loss. Whether it&#8217;s an <b data-path-to-node=\"42\" data-index-in-node=\"77\">M.2 SSD recovery Al Quoz</b> or a hard <b data-pa