ency service</b> that can get it done in 24 to 48 hours.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"37\"><b data-path-to-node=\"37\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Is it possible to recover files from a formatted hard drive?</b> Most of the time, yes. Formatting doesn&#8217;t delete the data immediately, it just hides it. As long as you didn&#8217;t save new stuff on it, we can usually find your old folders.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"38\"><b data-path-to-node=\"38\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">What is the success rate for HDD recovery in Dubai?</b> We have a success rate of over 95%. But it depends on how bad the damage is. If the internal disks are scratched, it might be impossible, so bring it to us as soon as it fails!</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"39\"><b data-path-to-node=\"39\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Will opening my hard drive at home ruin the data?</b> Yes, definitely. Hard drives are sealed tight. If you open it at home, dust will get in and ruin everything the second you turn it on. Please don&#8217;t try it!</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"40\"><b data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Do I have to pay if the recovery is unsuccessful?</b> No. We have a <b data-path-to-node=\"40\" data-index-in-node=\"64\">&#8220;No Data, No Fee&#8221;</b> policy. If we can&#8217;t get your important files back because the damage is too much, you don&#8217;t pay us anything for the attempt.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"42\">Get Your Files Back with the HDD Recovery Al Quoz Specialists</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"43\">Losing data doesn&#8217;t have to be the end. Whether it’s your own <b data-path-to-node=\"43\" data-index-in-node=\"62\">laptop hard drive recovery Al Quoz</b> or important <b data-path-to-node=\"43\" data-index-in-node=\"110\">internal hard drive recovery Al Quoz</b> for your company, we know how to help. Don&#8217;t let amateurs mess with your important files. Choose the lab that Al Quoz families and businesses have trusted for a long time.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"44\