restore your original documents.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\"><b class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"19,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">USB Drive Not Showing Data Recovery Karama:</b><span class=\"\"> We investigate hidden partitions and directory failures to find your &#8220;missing&#8221; files.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"21\">Our Professional USB Recovery Process: How We Save Your Data</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"22\"><span class=\"\">We have designed our workflow to be as transparent and stress-free as possible.</span> <b class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">Since</b><span class=\"\"> we know you are dealing with a difficult situation,</span><span class=\"\"> we prioritize clear communication.</span></p>\n<ol start=\"1\" data-path-to-node=\"23\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\"><b class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Initial Consultation:</b><span class=\"\"> Contact us to describe the failure.</span> <b class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"23,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">Subsequently</b><span class=\"\">,</span><span class=\"\"> we offer secure pickup across Karama and Dubai.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\"><b class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Laboratory Diagnosis:</b><span class=\"\"> Our engineers perform a non-destructive evaluation.</span> <b class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"23,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"74\">Then</b><span class=\"\">,</span><span class=\"\"> within a few hours,</span><span class=\"\"> we provide a fixed quote and a list of recoverable files.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\"><b class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">The Recovery Phase:</b><span class=\"\"> We perform the necessary micro-repairs or chip-off imaging.</span> <b class=\"\" data-path-to-node=\"23,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">Notably</b><span class=\"\">,</span><