ly.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\"><b data-path-to-node=\"46\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Does TRIM make it impossible to get data back?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\">Not always, but you have to be fast. If you lose data, turn the device off right away so TRIM doesn&#8217;t start cleaning the drive.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"47\"><b data-path-to-node=\"47\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">4. How long does the recovery take?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"47\">We check it in 4 hours. Most jobs are done in 2 to 5 days, but we have an &#8220;Emergency&#8221; service for 24-hour turnaround.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"48\"><b data-path-to-node=\"48\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">5. What is &#8220;No Data, No Fee&#8221;?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"48\">If we can&#8217;t get back the important files you need, you don&#8217;t pay us the recovery fee. It&#8217;s totally risk-free for you.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"49\"><b data-path-to-node=\"49\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">6. Do you work on Macs?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"49\">Yes! we specialize in both Intel and the new M1/M2/M3 MacBooks, even if the chips are soldered to the board.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"51\">Contact Your Al Barsha Heights SSD Recovery Experts Now</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"52\">Don&#8217;t let a software glitch or a hardware crash ruin your day. Whether it&#8217;s a single laptop or a big office server, the team at <a href=\"https://recoverydata.ae/\"><b data-path-to-node=\"52\" data-index-in-node=\"128\">Recovery Data</b></a> has the skills and the local lab to help you out. We are the top choice for fixing flash data in the UAE.</p>\n</div>\n','https://recoverydata.ae/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/19-1.jpg','published','2026-02-28 05:08:19','SSD Data Recovery Al Barsha Heights - +971564101040','Professional SSD data recovery in Al Barsha Heights, Dubai. Recover lost or corrupted files from NVMe, M.2 and SATA SSDs',NULL,'https://recoverydata.ae/ssd-data-recovery-al-barsha-heights/','SS