hone Data Recovery FAQs</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"46\"><b data-path-to-node=\"46\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How much does iPhone data recovery cost in JVC?</b> The cost depends on the type of failure. Logical recoveries (software) are generally more affordable, while physical recoveries (micro-soldering/chip-off) require more labor. We provide a free diagnostic and a transparent quote before any work begins.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"47\"><b data-path-to-node=\"47\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can you recover data if my iPhone won’t turn on?</b> Yes. Most of our successful cases involve &#8220;dead&#8221; iPhones. We specialize in motherboard repair to temporarily revive the device for data extraction.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"48\"><b data-path-to-node=\"48\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How long does the recovery process take?</b> Standard recoveries usually take 2 to 4 business days. Emergency forensic cases can often be expedited within 24 hours.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"49\"><b data-path-to-node=\"49\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Is my personal data kept private?</b> Absolutely. We offer a <b data-path-to-node=\"49\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">privacy-first iPhone data retrieval JVC</b> service. Your data is handled in a secure lab, and we sign a Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) upon request.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"50\"><b data-path-to-node=\"50\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Do you provide a &#8220;No Data, No Fee&#8221; policy?</b> Yes, we offer a <b data-path-to-node=\"50\" data-index-in-node=\"59\">no data, no charge iPhone recovery JVC</b> guarantee. If your critical files are not recoverable, you owe us nothing.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"51\"><b data-path-to-node=\"51\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can you recover data after a factory reset?</b> Recovery after a factory reset is extremely difficult due to iOS encryption. However, if you have a partial iCloud backup or an iTunes &#8220;ghost&#8221; file, we can often reconstruct your data.</p>\n<h2 data-path-t