iness Hard Drive Recovery near Al Barsha Heights</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24\">For companies in Al Barsha Heights, being down means losing money. Our <b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"71\">business hard drive recovery near Al Barsha Heights</b> service covers big servers and office storage (RAID/NAS). We offer &#8220;Emergency&#8221; status for business clients, with engineers working through the night to get your databases back online fast.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"26\">Common Problems We Fix Every Day</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">Our team is trained to find and fix almost any storage failure. We handle these issues every day:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"28\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Clicking or Beeping:</b> This means the internal parts have crashed.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Dead Drives:</b> Often from a power surge; the drive doesn&#8217;t even spin.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Firmware Bugs:</b> When the drive is &#8220;locked&#8221; or shows the wrong size (like 0GB).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Accidental Formatting:</b> When you wipe the drive or reinstall Windows by mistake.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Deleted Files:</b> Getting back data that was emptied from the trash.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,5,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,5,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Slow Performance:</b> When the drive is dying and makes your computer freeze.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28,6,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Liquid Damage:</b> Professional cleaning for drives that got wet.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 d