ight. Recovery Data has become a top name in Dubai because we’ve invested in the best equipment to handle sensitive corporate and personal info.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\">ISO-Certified Lab Standards</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"11\">Our lab follows very strict ISO rules. This means the way we handle your device is secure and professional. This is super important for law firms or medical clinics in Al Barsha South who have to follow privacy laws. We make sure your info is safe from the moment our courier picks it up until we give it back on an encrypted drive.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Class 100 Cleanroom for Physical Repairs</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Hard drives are very sensitive. Just one tiny speck of dust can ruin the whole thing if you open it in a normal room. Our place has a certified &#8220;Class 100 Cleanroom.&#8221; This lets our engineers safely do mechanical repairs, like changing broken parts inside the drive without any dirt getting in.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\">We Keep Your Data Private</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">We know your data is personal. Whether it’s business secrets or family photos, our team follows strict privacy rules. Once you check and confirm your data is back, we delete our working copies using military grade standards. Your privacy is always 100% safe with us.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"17\">Comprehensive Specialized Pickup &amp; Recovery Solutions</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"18\">Every data loss story is a bit different. Our lab is ready to work on all kinds of gadgets, making sure we provide specialized solutions no matter what brand or system you use.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"19\">SSD Pickup Recovery Al Barsha South</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20\">SSDs are tricky because they usually just die suddenly without any warning sounds. Since they don&#8217;t have moving parts, the problem is usually an electronic chip or software error. Our specialists in <b data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index