o tools that normal shops just don&#8217;t have.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"24\">Case Example: Saving a Mirdif Business</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"25\">A distribution company near Mirdif City Centre had three drives fail at once on their Dell server. Their backups were old and useless. We got the drives to our lab fast. By fixing the physical parts and rebuilding the data manually, we saved 99% of their files. It saved them from a huge loss</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"26\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\"><b data-path-to-node=\"27\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How long does RAID recovery Mirdif usually take?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"27\">Usually, it’s about 2 to 4 days. But if it’s a big emergency, we have a 24/7 service that can often get it done in less than 24 hours.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28\"><b data-path-to-node=\"28\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Can you fix a RAID 5 if two drives failed?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"28\">Yes, we can! Normally RAID 5 only allows one drive to fail, but we have special ways to fix the physical damage on the disks to get enough info for a rebuild.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"29\"><b data-path-to-node=\"29\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Do you come to my office in Mirdif?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"29\">For the most part, we need the drives in our super-clean lab to be safe. But we can pick them up from you, or even do remote help if it’s just a software issue.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How much does it cost?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\">It depends on how many drives you have and how bad the damage is. We always give you a clear price after the first check-up.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\"><b data-path-to-node=\"31\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Is my data safe with you?</b></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"31\">Yes, 100%. We can sign an NDA (privacy paper) with you. We keep everything locked up and delete