ta-path-to-node=\"26,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"88\">Finally</b>, once you are happy, we put the files on a new drive for you.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"28\"> Saving Years of Research</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"29\">Recently, a researcher at a big university here in Abu Dhabi had their external SSD fail. <b data-path-to-node=\"29\" data-index-in-node=\"90\">Unfortunately</b>, it had three years of research that wasn&#8217;t published yet! The computer wouldn&#8217;t even see the drive, and two other shops said it was impossible to fix. <b data-path-to-node=\"29\" data-index-in-node=\"256\">However</b>, when it came to our lab, our <b data-path-to-node=\"29\" data-index-in-node=\"294\">data recovery specialist Abu Dhabi</b> found the &#8220;controller&#8221; chip was totally dead.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"30\"><b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">By using</b> a &#8220;chip-off&#8221; trick where we took the memory chips out and read them directly, we bypassed the damage. <b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"111\">In the end</b>, we recovered 100% of the files. The researcher was so happy they could finish their work on time. <b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"221\">Clearly</b>, this is why people see us as the experts for <b data-path-to-node=\"30\" data-index-in-node=\"275\">professional data recovery Abu Dhabi</b>.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"32\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"33\"><b data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How much does professional data recovery cost in Abu Dhabi?</b> The price depends on what is broken, not how much data you have. <b data-path-to-node=\"33\" data-index-in-node=\"125\">For example</b>, fixing hardware in a Cleanroom cost more than just fixing a software error. We always give you a fixed quote after we check it.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"34\"><b data-path-to-node=\"34\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">How long does it take to get 