are just can&#8217;t handle.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"12\">Human Error and Logical Corruption</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Sometimes the hardware is actually fine, <b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"41\">but</b> the data is gone because someone accidentally formatted it or deleted something important. Or maybe a server move went wrong. <b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"171\">In these cases</b>, we do deep scans of the server&#8217;s hidden &#8220;metadata.&#8221; <b data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"239\">Often</b>, we can find &#8220;ghost&#8221; copies of your files that are still sitting on the disk even if they look deleted.</p>\n<h2 data-path-to-node=\"15\">Why Recovery Data is the Top Choice for SAIF Zone Server Experts</h2>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16\">Trust and skill are the two most important things when you need your data back. <b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"80\">To ensure this</b>, Recovery Data has spent a lot on the right tools to handle big company hardware. Our lab is one of the very few in the UAE with the latest workstations and a certified Cleanroom. <b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"275\">Additionally</b>, we know that for businesses in the Sharjah Airport Free Zone, keeping data private is a big deal. <b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"387\">That is why</b> we provide <b data-path-to-node=\"16\" data-index-in-node=\"410\">Server Data Loss Solutions SAIF Zone</b> that include full privacy agreements (NDAs). Your drives are safe from the moment they leave your office until we bring the data back.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17\"> We are very honest; <b data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"107\">for instance</b>, we give you a full report of what we can recover before you pay for the final service. <b data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"208\">Ultimately</b>, this honesty has made us the favorite <b data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-i